  "licensed_cross_system_claim": "Within migratory birds, temperature responsiveness weakens with migration distance; independently, local plant-pollinator systems show strong but unequal temperature responsiveness. Together with PAYOFF-B predictive-connectivity evidence, these results are consistent with an information-distance axis.",
